      ],
      "explanation": "The added code establishes the previously missing dependency. leaderLoop reads the commitment index after commitCh notification and selects only inflight indexes at or below it. processLogs sends corresponding command tuples through fsmMutateCh; prepareLog includes LogCommand. The supplied FSM application closure applies the command and responds through its future. The G_apply-to-O_commit direction and depends_all kind are provisionally appropriate as a necessary component. An F2 grounding update removes only the now-answered handoff uncertainty.",
      "alternatives": "Followers consume LeaderCommitIndex through appendEntries, and replication support can arrive through snapshots. Neither path removes the ordinary leader command's dependence on commitment-index calculation.",
      "counterexample_reasoning": "The consumer checks index bounds and previously dispatched progress; it does not independently recalculate quorum support. An unsupported calculator advance could therefore authorize command dispatch. Conversely, correct calculation alone cannot exclude false reports, unsafe membership histories or downstream correspondence failures.",
      "limitations": [
        "The rest of runFSM, batching completion and future synchronization are not fully supplied.",
        "The proposed grounding update requires normal versioned acceptance and review; no implementation execution is claimed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope_limitations": [
        "This is a boundary relation to an unresolved producer responsibility; it does not add O_replication_support to U_commit's checked obligations."
      ],
      "target_id": "R_commit_report_boundary",
      "aspect": "decomposition",
      "status": "no_issue_found",
      "source_ids": [
        "commitment.go:1:104",
